  "bodyHash": "dd89b0347ba1f974",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">原版專案將很快更新，請密切關注<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfishs-gun-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方頁面</a>！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">這是<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfishs-gun-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MrCrayfish's Gun Mod</a>的非官方移植版，<strong>需要<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Framework</a></strong>。</span></p>\n<p><em><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">《MrCrayfish's Gun Mod》是一款充滿新意與刺激的武器模組，擁有獨特的設計理念。新增九種武器，皆高度可自訂，讓你打造專屬獨特變體。透過安裝配件與附魔，你可以提升武器屬性，打造更強大的版本。使用染料即可改變任何武器與配件的顏色。本模組還新增了手榴彈與震撼彈！</span></em></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">移植版所做的變更：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">1. 震撼彈的聲音現已改為單聲道（參考<a href=\"https://github.com/MrCrayfish/MrCrayfishGunMod/pull/506\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MrCrayfishGunMod#506</a>，由 ffmpeg 產生的新檔案）；</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">2. 現在可將染色過的 CGM 物品浸入裝滿水的鍋子中以洗去顏色；</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">3. 修正了彈殼的模型；</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">4. 修復了換彈動畫中彈藥物品的渲染方向；</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">5. 額外實作了以下模組的相容性：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Backpacked</a>；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Backpacks</a>；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/travelers-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traveler's Backpack</a>；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-planes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Planes</a>；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">...</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">注意：</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">如果 MrCrayfish 也已更新至此版本，請優先使用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfishs-gun-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">原版模組</a>！</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
